# mambo — "Paxito", an original mambo-flavoured tune for the PC speaker,
# written for pax by its px18 lane (2026-10-09), GPL-3.0 with the rest
# of the repository.
#
# It is a new melody, written from rhythm and style alone: a piano
# montuno's syncopated figure in A minor (i - iv - V7 - i, notes on the
# "and" anticipating the beat, against a 2-3 clave feel), a brass-like
# hook of off-beat stabs and short runs, a bridge (F - G - E7) that
# climbs to the hook again, and a stab ending. It is not a
# transcription, an arrangement or a paraphrase of any existing work;
# in particular it is not, and borrows nothing from, the "Mambo" of
# West Side Story or any other published mambo.
#
# 34 bars of 4/4 at 184 quarter notes a minute: 44.3 s.
